  unitName: Red Slash Farlon
  unitId: 10333
  unitNumber: 447
  description: The 12 Guardians of the Gods, made up of the most talented people
    from across every country. Farlon, one of the them, had absolute confidence in
    his abilities. As a young man he was usually very polite, but he was very competitive
    when it came to his comrades, and it's said he refused to open up to any of the
    other Guardians other than his sweetheart. It has also been told that he held
    strong ill will against the leader of the Guardians.
  summonDesc: Swordsman of the 12 Guardians!<br>That is who I am!<br>Be sure not
    to forget it!
  fusionDesc: Give me more magic power.<br>I'll prove to you that I am<br>the strongest
    around.
